Subject: [PATCH 50/51] ss3ds: route the player's run-button test
 (sub_0205DE88) to SS3DS_RunHeld

Both callers (walk and bike/turn start in unk_0205CB48) ask 'is B held' only to decide running. Retarget the bl to SS3DS_RunHeld(avatar, keys), defined by the port, so the ZL run toggle can flip it.
---
 port/soulsilver-native-play/maploader/arg-overrides.json  | 3 ++-
 port/soulsilver-native-play/maploader/call-retargets.json | 3 ++-
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/port/soulsilver-native-play/maploader/arg-overrides.json b/port/soulsilver-native-play/maploader/arg-overrides.json
index 71a3d33..f9cf07b 100644
--- a/port/soulsilver-native-play/maploader/arg-overrides.json
+++ b/port/soulsilver-native-play/maploader/arg-overrides.json
@@ -14,5 +14,6 @@
  "SSAsm_G2x_SetBlendBrightness_": 3,
  "SSAsm_G2x_SetBlendBrightnessExt_": 6,
  "SSAsm_G2x_ChangeBlendBrightness_": 2,
- "SS3DS_BattleMonOBJ_NewAll": 2
+ "SS3DS_BattleMonOBJ_NewAll": 2,
+ "SS3DS_RunHeld": 2
 }
diff --git a/port/soulsilver-native-play/maploader/call-retargets.json b/port/soulsilver-native-play/maploader/call-retargets.json
index c5a62e9..a7a858a 100644
